# Prismabasher (ruling): "The value of X is calculated when Prismabasher's last ability triggers for the purpose of defining the maximum number
# of target creatures. It is calculated again when the ability resolves to determine the amount of the power and toughness bonus." Two colors
# are among Bot1's permanents as the ability triggers, so it targets the Elvish Mystic and the Monastery Swiftspear. In response Bot2
# Lightning Bolts the Swiftspear: red is gone, X is one as the ability resolves, and the Mystic alone gets +1/+1 (2/2).

